OL,3,CHope of finding Japan earthquake
OL,4,Csurvivors dwindling as death toll hits
OL,5,C30
OL,7,FThe number of people killed after a
OL,8,Fpowerful earthquake hit southwestern
OL,9,FJapan has risen to 30, the country's
OL,10,Fprime minister has confirmed.
OL,12,FHope of finding survivors is now
OL,13,Fstarting to dwindle after the
OL,14,Fmagnitude 6.8 earthquake shook Japan's
OL,15,Fsouthern main island of Kyushu on
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
