OL,3,CHope of finding Japan earthquake
OL,4,Csurvivors dwindling as death toll hits
OL,5,C30
OL,7,FSeveral people died when part of a
OL,8,Fshopping mall in Kumamoto partially
OL,9,Fcollapsed, leading to an explosion,
OL,10,Fwhile there was also widespread damage
OL,11,Fto homes and power lines.
OL,13,FAt least 86 people were injured, five
OL,14,Fof them seriously.
OL,16,FThe quake also caused a chimney to
OL,17,Fcollapse at a Nippon Paper factory in
OL,18,FYatsushiro city, killing eight people,
OL,19,Fthe Kumamoto prefectural government
OL,20,Fdisaster team said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
