OL,3,CHope of finding Japan earthquake
OL,4,Csurvivors dwindling as death toll hits
OL,5,C30
OL,7,FNearly 19,000 homes are still without
OL,8,Felectricity and running water, with
OL,9,Fthousands of people seeking shelter in
OL,10,Fmore than 400 evacuation centres.
OL,12,FHowever, keeping them cool is proving
OL,13,Fto be a constant battle, with
OL,14,Ftemperatures in the region expected to
OL,15,Freach 39C in the coming days.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
