OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785442291
OL,3,CHope of finding Japan earthquake
OL,4,Csurvivors dwindling as death toll hits
OL,5,C30
OL,7,FThe Ministry of Environment issued a
OL,8,Fheatstroke alert for the Kumamoto area
OL,9,Fon Thursday, as hundreds of air
OL,10,Fconditioning units and power
OL,11,Fgenerators were sent to evacuation
OL,12,Fcentres.
OL,14,FIn the town of Hikawa, one of the
OL,15,Fhardest-hit areas in Kumamoto, some
OL,16,Fresidents are staying inside their
OL,17,Fvehicles in parks or at the town hall
OL,18,Fparking lot.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
