OL,3,CHope of finding Japan earthquake
OL,4,Csurvivors dwindling as death toll hits
OL,5,C30
OL,7,FThe most serious damage was at the
OL,8,FAeon Mall in the town of Kashima,
OL,9,Fwhere 3,000 customers were evacuated
OL,10,Fto a parking lot before the explosion
OL,11,Fhappened in another part of the mall.
OL,13,FThe blast caused the second floor to
OL,14,Fcollapse, trapping people who were
OL,15,Fstill working.
OL,17,FAs of early Thursday, six people were
OL,18,Fconfirmed to have died at the mall
OL,19,Fsite among the 11 people pulled out of
OL,20,Fthe wreckage, according to Kumamoto
OL,21,Fauthorities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
