PN,31606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785442291
OL,3,CHope of finding Japan earthquake
OL,4,Csurvivors dwindling as death toll hits
OL,5,C30
OL,7,FPrime Minister Sanae Takaichi told
OL,8,Freporters the central government will
OL,9,Ftake a lead role in coordinating the
OL,10,Fvarious rescue efforts. Restoring
OL,11,Felectricity, gas and water to stricken
OL,12,Fareas, while supplying fresh water was
OL,13,Fkey, she said.
OL,15,F"The needs on the ground are
OL,16,Fconstantly changing. To put to rest
OL,17,Fthe people's feelings of uncertainty,
OL,18,Fwe will do all that needs to be done,"
OL,19,Fshe insisted.
